{"ref":"character:death-character","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Death is a secret playable character from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. His starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Death_Spiral.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:death-spiral"}," ",{"t":"Death Spiral","r":"weapon:death-spiral"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["31 October 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_DEATH"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Death_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Death_Spiral.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:death-spiral"}," ",{"t":"Death Spiral","r":"weapon:death-spiral"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Make it feel at home."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 16,650"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ode_to_Castlevania-Castlevania_Harmony_of_Despair.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Dance of Illusions\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["255"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+100%"]]},{"label":"Might","cells":[["+20%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":21,"h":21,"a":"A sprite icon representing Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane linking to Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," \"Make it feel at home.\"\nFull unlock method hidden. Click \"Show Details\" to unhide."]},{"k":"p","c":["The player must start a run in ",{"t":"Ode to Castlevania","r":"stage:ode-to-castlevania-stage"}," while playing as ",{"i":"Sprite-Richter_Belmont.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:richter-belmont"}," ",{"t":"Richter Belmont","r":"character:richter-belmont"},", and then obtain the ",{"i":"Sprite-Endo_Gears.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:endo-gears"}," ",{"t":"Endo Gears","r":"weapon:endo-gears"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Peri_Pendulum.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"weapon:peri-pendulum"}," ",{"t":"Peri Pendulum","r":"weapon:peri-pendulum"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Myo_Lift.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:myo-lift"}," ",{"t":"Myo Lift","r":"weapon:myo-lift"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Epi_Head.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:epi-head"}," ",{"t":"Epi Head","r":"weapon:epi-head"},", which are unlocked after obtaining the ",{"i":"Sprite-Serpent_Gate.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:serpent-gate"}," ",{"t":"Serpent Gate","r":"relic:serpent-gate"},", then evolving them into the ",{"i":"Sprite-Clock_Tower.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:clock-tower"}," ",{"t":"Clock Tower","r":"weapon:clock-tower"}," and entering the boss fight against ",{"i":"Sprite-Death_(boss).png","w":24,"h":15}," Death. Doing this unlocks Death as a playable character."]},{"k":"p","c":["Note: When entering the boss fight against Death in Dracula's room, the player(s) must exit the run via the quit menu before the boss has a chance to take the player's weapons or the character unlock will fail."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once unlocked, Death can be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 16,650, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Death can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"sewardzead\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Death starts with +155 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", +100% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", and +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},". Stat-wise, Death is identical to ",{"i":"Sprite-Mask_of_the_Red_Death.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:mask-of-the-red-death"}," ",{"t":"Mask of the Red Death","r":"character:mask-of-the-red-death"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once the ",{"i":"Sprite-Ebony_and_Crimson_Stones.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:ebony-and-crimson-stones"}," ",{"t":"Ebony and Crimson Stones","r":"relic:ebony-and-crimson-stones"}," have been obtained, he morphs into a smaller version of his boss form, called ",{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Death.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"character:megalo-death"}," ",{"t":"Megalo Death","r":"character:megalo-death"},", upon reaching level 80. This transformation gives Death the ",{"i":"Sprite-Death_Hand.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"weapon:death-hand"}," ",{"t":"Death Hand","r":"weapon:death-hand"},", two giant skeletal hands that move in tandem with him and create large cracks in the ground that shake the screen and deal 65 base damage to enemies. In this form, he gains +200% Might, -20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},", and +100% ",{"i":"Sprite-Curse.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:curse"}," ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"},". He also cannot die in this form, but instead disappears at the time limit, ending the run automatically, similar to ",{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Menya_Moonspell.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:megalo-menya-moonspell"}," ",{"t":"Megalo Menya Moonspell","r":"character:megalo-menya-moonspell"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Ghost_Lino.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"character:ghost-lino"}," ",{"t":"Ghost Lino","r":"character:ghost-lino"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Death can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Death.png","w":120,"h":113,"c":["Death's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Death.gif","w":120,"h":111,"c":["Movement animation"]},{"i":"Unlock-Death.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Secrets menu icon"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Death's description is a reference to ",{"t":"Mask of the Red Death","r":"character:mask-of-the-red-death"},"'s description, \"A blasphemous mockery.\""]},{"c":["The hint for unlocking Death is likely a reference to how, in the Castlevania series, he is typically fought in the ",{"t":"Clock Tower","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Clock_and_Machine_Towers"},"."]},{"c":["The spell for unlocking Death refers to Death's human disguises, ",{"t":"Seward","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Seward"}," and ",{"t":"Zead","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Zead"},"."]},{"c":["Death is one of the very few characters in Vampire Survivors who has voice acting, alongside ",{"t":"Richter Belmont","r":"character:richter-belmont"}," and ",{"t":"Vlad Tepes Dracula","r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"},". He is voiced by ",{"t":"SungWon Cho","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SungWon_Cho"},", who is also the voice for Richter Belmont."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Death","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Death"}," on the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}